<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65062" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρμᾰρῠγ-ή</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flashing, sparkling,
				gleaming</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάμπει δ᾽ ὑπὸ μαρμαρυγαῖς ὁ χρυσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					3.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				116c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				69
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					213
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἀπολάμπουσαι ἀπὸ τῶν ὀμμάτων μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Damian.
					<u>Opt.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Adam.
				1.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> '<i>seeing
				sparks</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				24
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				518a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of any quick
			motion, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρμαρυγαὶ ποδῶν</span>
			<i>the quick twinkling</i> of the dancers' feet. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.265
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				203
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
